      "postID": "6494cf9696c5d80918475228",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2cc65a3e5e4b3102c0fd27|full_name}: Even people outside the size community can enjoy \"being the couch\" when watching movies. Maybe having our friends rest on us makes us feel important.\n\nC'mon, Tupper. Let the instance owner decide scaling limits for private instances (Invite, Invite+, Friends), not the world author. It helps everyone and hurts no one.\n\nEven breaking game worlds is fine in a small, private group that has already collectively decided that they're OK with it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "65ef78b03c092e38c9fb9be8",
