      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can think of an issue with this: In the case of a private tournament or some type of competitive game, there should be a way to control it to prevent cheating while keeping the instance type private.\n\nThe instance owner (or group owner/mod) of those private instances should be able to manually disable it in this case. Otherwise, I agree, it should be enabled by default.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
