      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6494cf9696c5d80918475228",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I personally don't agree that it should be removed from the creators hands. As a creator I feel like my world is my art and it should be experienced in the intended way. I don't want people looking over a wall and seeing something I'm building for example or looking ahead in a maze or finding a Easter egg. \n\nAs a compromise I think that the ability to turn scaling off completely should be removed from the world creators powers and instead we should only be able to play with the scale range.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
